window.products.push({"id":628154,"name":"FOXTEMO Faux Olive Tree, 6FT (71in 180CM) Olive Tree Artificial Indoor, Tall Fake Tree, Large Fake Plant for Home Decor Indoor Living Room Housewarmin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61orhEK0RoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Design & Fine Craftsmanship】 6ft artificial olive tree trunk made of wire and plastic and leaves are made of silk, trunk brushed with brown simulation paint, using the principle of the golden ratio of the division point, composed of 1008 leaves, olive tree using very fine craftsmanship, than the ordinary model upgraded the thickness of the textured clear leaves, the product is more aesthetic in addition to realistic. 【Size & Easy to Install】 The total height of the olive tree 6 FT (70.86'', 180CM ± 0.78''), Width adjustable (23.6''-34''), pot size (5'' * 6''), Pot made of cement mixture to increase the Weight so that the product is more stable, but also to avoid being knocked over by pets or children.olive tree to adopt segmented design, in order to reduce the rate of damage to the product in transit, after receiving the olive tree simply need to splice the two segments. 【Adjustable Angle and Shape】The trunk has a built-in wire so that the angle of the trunk can be adjusted if it is found to be unstable. The branches are also built-in wire, if you have a lot of space, you can adjust the branches rich, full, the width of the tree can be adjusted to a maximum of 34 ''.Change the shape of the tree to your liking in order to better fit your space. if you have any questions when adjusting, feel free to contact us. 【Multiple Scenes】 The olive tree consists of realistic bark texture, trunk, lush olive leaves and fruit, the olive tree is a symbol of peace, victory and hope. It fits every corner of your room, living room, bedroom, dining room, office, fireplace, staircase, foyer, front room, etc. The planter is designed with thickened plastic that is not easily damaged, and you can also put it in your favorite pot of different materials that fit the style of your home. 【Light Up Your Life with Greenery】Easy to maintain, just need to wipe the dust on the olive leaves with a damp cloth or rag regularly. Perfect Christmas, Thanksgiving, Housewarming, Birthday, Valentine's Day gift for friends or family. Note: When removing the item from the box, it may need to be reshaped to achieve the desired look.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61orhEK0RoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FOXTEMO","source_asin":"B0B85GCZRF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-628154","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B85GCZRF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B85GCZRF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
