window.products.push({"id":628156,"name":"Duraflame Infrared Quartz Juniper Electric Log Set with Crackling Sound Effect","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819m6qtMOAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This infrared quartz log set heater can be used to upgrade your nonworking fireplace. Simply place the log set into your existing fireplace and watch brilliant flames project onto the back fireplace surface. The realistic log set mimics juniper wood with the ember bed sitting in a black fire grate. The rolling flame effect works with or without heat and features five brightness settings. Turn the heat on for supplemental zone heating up to 1,000 square feet. Control the log set from anywhere in the room using the included remote control. Manufactured and distributed by Twin- Star International, Inc., under license from Duraflame, Inc. duraflame, the flame symbol and logo are registered trademarks of Duraflame, Inc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819m6qtMOAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Duraflame","source_asin":"B07YQ7NDKR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-628156","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YQ7NDKR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YQ7NDKR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
