window.products.push({"id":628171,"name":"18-Piece Pressure Cooker Accessories Set for Instant Pot 6 Qt, Steamer Basket, Nonstick Springform Pan, Egg Steam Rack, Egg Bites Mold, Mini Mitt, Sea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cDBKST4QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"INSTANT UPGRADE — Cook a wide range of new wholesome & flavorful dishes with the existing pot, and have more healthier food choices, with less oil & more nutrients - simply get pressure cooker accessories, specially designed to simplify the cooking process and add versatility - steam veggies or have hard boiled eggs, make pastas or seafood, bake cheesecake or a pie, and do much more with this accessories set for your instant pot that comprises of all the essentials! ALL-IN-ONE — 18 PCS SET of pressure cooker accessories consists of 1 stainless-steel steamer basket, 1 non-stick springform pan, 1 steamer egg holder rack, 1 silicone egg bites mold, 2 silicone sealing rings for instant pot, 1 foldable steamer rack insert, 4 cooking magnetic cheat sheets with cooking time for common food, 5 pieces instant pot cleaning brush set & 2 silicone mitts - take the pot-in-pot cooking to an all new level! PREMIUM QUALITY & WIDE COMPATIBILITY — Made with FOOD-SAFE silicone & rust-proof stainless steel, our instant pot pressure cooker accessories are very sturdy, can be washed easily in the dishwasher, and are sure to last really long. The food steamer basket is compatible with 6/8-qt instant pot, while pressure cooker sealing rings can be used with most 5/6-quart pots including ip-duo50, ip-duo60, ip-lux50, ip-lux60, ip-lux60v3, smart-60, ultra-6, ip-csg60 & ip-csg50. MULTIPURPOSE — Designed thoughtfully for better functional effectiveness, the basket has a silicone covered handle to let you comfortably lift it out of the instant cooker, 7’’ non-stick springform cake pan that can also be used as a baking pan, egg bites mold which can double as an ice cube tray/food storage tray, 2 rings so that one can be used for sweet & other for savoury food, etc. – best one pot pressure cooker or electric pressure cooker accessories set! COOKER CLEANING SET — Cleaning set includes silicone scraper, two-piece deep clean brush set, sponge brush and multi-use washing sponge. clean any tiny corner that is hard to get into by hand. the different sizes are ready for different tasks all the time so that you can clean your instant pot and other kitchen appliance easier and faster!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cDBKST4QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AOZITA","source_asin":"B07KXR9F5W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-628171","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KXR9F5W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KXR9F5W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
