window.products.push({"id":628400,"name":"West Bend 84596 6-Quart Programmable Crockery Cooker, Stainless Steel (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41APZcqWZQL._AC_.jpg","description":"An ideal size for five to six people, this 6-quart-capacity programmable appliance cooks up everything from soups and casseroles to pot roasts and curries, making dinnertime easier than ever. Simply add the ingredients, press the \"temp\" button to choose between high or low temperature settings--or \"keep warm\" for warming previously cooked foods, then press \"cook\", and it takes care of the rest, leaving you free to time for other household chores or better yet, for putting your feet up and relaxing until dinner's ready. The electric cooker can also be programmed to cook at low or high temperatures for anywhere from 4 to 12 hours, followed by \"keep warm\" with the timer counting up from zero to show the elapsed time. For safety and peace of mind, the cooker will automatically shut off after 20 hours of total cooking time. The oval-shaped appliance provides a removable crock, which doubles as a convenient serving dish, and a glass cover that helps keep in heat, moisture, and nutrients, plus allows for checking on food at a glance. Heavy-duty cast stainless-steel handles ensure safe transport, and an instruction manual with recipes for stews, soups, and meat dishes comes included. The heating base and cord can be wiped down with a damp cloth, and the crock and glass cover clean up easily by hand or in the dishwasher. The 250-watt UL-listed slow cooker measures approximately 14-1/2 by 14-1/2 by 10-1/2 inches and carries a one-year limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41APZcqWZQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"West Bend","source_asin":"B000FCPYQI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-628400","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000FCPYQI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000FCPYQI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
