window.products.push({"id":628415,"name":"Multifunctional Clothes Clips for Hanging Clothes Food Packages Plastic Dress Pants Clothes Pins for Anti-Slip Pants Hanger Clips Air-Drying Laundry C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cJzlckR9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Great Accessory for Your Clothes When your closet is full of clothes and pants, you know how important it is to use a convenient clothes clip to keep them organized. Our laundry clip is great for air drying your clothes, skirts and pants and keeping them in good condition and shape. You can use it to dry clothes in the laundry room or clip clothes in the closet, towels in the bathroom, food packaging bags in the kitchen, etc. This is a very necessary clothing hanging accessory. Make it Easier to Organize Clothes and Pants When you need to air dry the washed clothes, use this clothes clip to better maintain the shape of the clothes. Moreover, your closet can always be kept tidy. Easy to Clip These plastic clothes pins can be easily opened without a lot of effort, and it is very simple to use. A Good Helper for Your Closet These clothes clips allow you to organize your closet in only one order, saving more time to find clothes Small Size These anti-slip clothes hanger clips are very small (7.2 x 2.2 x 2.2cm), which can be stored conveniently without taking up too much space. Specification: Material: plastic Size: 7.2 x 2.2 x 2.2cm/pc Features: anti-slip, multi-purpose, small size Great for air drying clothes and pants. Packing List: 20 x Clothes Clips","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cJzlckR9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Houcervek","source_asin":"B09MK9F8Q4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-628415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MK9F8Q4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MK9F8Q4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":628416,"name":"Logosol Smart Pusher with Bailey's Heavy-Weight Logger Socks (1 Pair)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31jX+0v3L-L._AC_.jpg","description":"Keep your feet nice and warm while you're felling trees! The unique Smart-Pusher from Logosol ensures that the tree falls in the intended direction, which is essential for safety when felling trees. Of course, always have felling wedges at hand, but if you are unfamiliar with chainsaws or have trees that stand where there is risk that they fall on something, you can significantly improve safety by using a Smart-Pusher. When felling a tree, the Smart-Pusher presses against the trunk with thousands of pounds of pressure. Please Note: Felling trees is a dangerous operation. This is shown in several reports on occupational injuries in the forestry sector. But an accident may occur even if you are only going to fell a tree at home in your garden. Use caution and always wear PPE for safety. Bailey's Logger Wear heavyweight socks are great for cool and cold temperature work conditions. The Wick Dry soft cotton and acrylic blend adds cushion that keeps your warm feet warm and dry. Extra Heavyweight socks are very thick, so they make your boots fits snug. Large size only (fits sizes 9-12). Made in the USA. Includes: (1) Logosol Smart-Pusher (1) Pair of Heavyweight Socks","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31jX+0v3L-L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Logosol/Bailey's","source_asin":"B07YM2K194","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-628416","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YM2K194","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YM2K194","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
