window.products.push({"id":628454,"name":"Trudeau 2 in 1 Large Cooking Spatula, Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VSuoIhLRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Prepare the perfect cake with this 2-in-1 spoon spatula! specially designed to scoop up batter, it is non-stick and will not scratch bowls or cookware. It's made of a single piece of high-quality silicone for maximum hygiene and is stain and odor resistant. The smaller end of the spatula can be used for smaller tasks, like adding frosting on a cake. Its integrated tool rest will help in keeping your counter clean. Pop it in the dishwasher when you're done.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VSuoIhLRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trudeau","source_asin":"B06XJFWZMM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-628454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XJFWZMM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XJFWZMM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":628455,"name":"AHDECOR Wooden Picture Ledge with Coat Hooks Wall Mount Hanger Coat Rack Display Shelf for Home Wall Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cyso3bpsS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These Wall Shelves are floating shelves that provide an attractive and unique way to display objects. The ability to place these products on the wall any way you want gives you latitude for your own style and design. You are not locked into a specific location or assembly. Easy instructions make setup a snap. There are even new screws with wall anchors so you don't have to find a stud. A template and level come with this wall shelves making the install easy and fun.   Number of Shelves: 1Color: White Shelf Style: Floating Metal Finish: Silver Material: Natural wood  Finish: Anti-Stained Accessories Included: Hardware Care instructions : Wipe clean using a damp cloth and a mild cleaner. Wipe dry with a clean cloth. Unit Dimensions: 15”W x 6.8\"H x 4.53\"D","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cyso3bpsS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AHDECOR","source_asin":"B08Z3J1DGD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-628455","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z3J1DGD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z3J1DGD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":628456,"name":"Pots and Pans Set Nonstick Ceramic – 9-Piece Non Stick Frying Pan and Cooking Pot Set – Red Aluminum Pans, Ceramic Coating, Glass Lids, Silicone Handl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TGX88XFuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made with Ceramic, Silicone, and StyleLet’s be honest—you wouldn’t cook as much if nonstick surfaces didn’t make the cleanup easier. But some nonstick surfaces are questionable, scratching and flaking off into your food and exposing the metal. Leave behind toxic pan linings, but keep the easy cleanup. Your ceramic pots and pans set is nonstick, not noxious. Cook with speed thanks to fast-heating aluminum and glass lids with heat-trapping silicone seals.Top-Notch MaterialsLet this become your convenient, everyday cookware set. Your dishwasher safe pots and pans are corrosion resistant, BPA-free, and cast from durable aluminum and steel. Avoid using metallic or scratchy utensils while cooking. For maximum longevity, handwashing with non-abrasive implements is recommended.A Gift They’ll UseYou want to give your special someone some home essentials to support them after their big move, but you aren’t sure where to start. How about pots and pans? Give them a central, important piece of any kitchen and home. Set them up to be able to eat healthy meals and stop using dangerously worn out, PFC-shedding pans.Home Goods with HistoryFind out why so many well-fed folks love their nonstick cookware sets and kitchen utensils from Hercules Gourmet. Hercules is made by Mundial, a home goods company with over 125 years of experience in making home life easier. Put your trust in pots and pans backed by a longstanding legacy and a dedication to your happiness.Cook cleaner and clean faster with Hercules Gourmet Cookware.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TGX88XFuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mundial","source_asin":"B08WY9RFPP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-628456","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WY9RFPP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WY9RFPP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
