window.products.push({"id":628517,"name":"FunSpt Foldable Fabric Closet Underwear Organizer Drawer Divider Dresser Organizer Storage Box, 7 Cells","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51noxlonW+L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Welcome to our store. Having a happy shopping time here.  You may be bothered with your underwear drawer is always a mess and out of control. You need a organization help urgently.It helps you with storing stuffs which helps you don¡¯t hassle in the morning to the little items anymore. Product details: material:No-woven fabric. SIZE: 6 section divider - 32*16*10cm 7 section divider - 32*32*10cm 8 section divider - 28*16*10cm 24 section divider - 32*32*10cm Installation: There is a zipper on the bottom once you zip, they stand up into their box shape. The stitching is solid and the dividers stand up once you insert the cardboard. How to use: You can use the 24-cell dividers for socks, stockings, ties, scarves or other accessories. The 6-cell dividers can be used for underwear, larger scarves, or tanks. The 7-cell can be used for bras/sports bras. Actually, the methods above are just suggestions. You can use your imagination to organize what you want. Features: Perfect for organizing camisoles, tights, scarves,belts, crafts, sewing supplies, office supplies. Perfect for jewelry, baby clothes, nursery items,socks,lingerie,swimsuits,stockings,tank tops,etc. Fit in dresser drawer, under a bed, dorm room dresser, Closet. Fit in wardrobe,office,baby room, laundry room,mud room,dorm,etc. Notice: 1.There may be a slight difference in product sizes due to manual measurement 2.Color Same as Picture but pls Note the Actual Colors may Slightly Vary from the Pictures due to the Different Monitor Settings and Light Environment When Photos were Shot.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51noxlonW+L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FunSpt","source_asin":"B08DL2CBK2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-628517","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DL2CBK2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DL2CBK2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":628518,"name":"Tiger Chef 1 OZ Measured Liquor Pourer Tail with Collar Liquor Spout Pourer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ISIvlb8xL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"★ SIMPE AND AFFORDABLE: Make preparing mixed drinks simple and affordable with this great measured pourer. ★ INNOVATIVE DESIGN: Made of hard plastic with graduated fins on the neck, Tiger Chef’s Liquor Pourer fits on most standard liquor bottles and serves as a liquor pourer and drip stopper. ★ MEASURE PERFECTLY: Pour a perfectly measured amount of liquor every time with these Colored Measured Liquor Bottle Pourers. Every color measures a different amount. ★ STOP WASTING MONEY: Say Good-bye to your free-flow pourers that eat away at your margins and inventory by giving away extra ounces with each pour. ★ THE ONLY POURERS WITH 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Buy with confidence because we offer a Money Back Guarantee if you do not love this product!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ISIvlb8xL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiger Chef","source_asin":"B00MQ218ZQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-628518","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MQ218ZQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MQ218ZQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
