window.products.push({"id":628606,"name":"Le Creuset Wine Opener Vertical Lever Replacement Screw","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rkC1w9uSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed for vertical style corkscrew, this replacement screw installs easily and maintains proper function after the original screw begins to wear. The unit's three coats of non-stick coating exterior glides effortlessly through even stubborn, dry, brittle, and fragile corks--making it an ideal choice when enjoying aged and vintage wines with friends and dinner guests. Furthermore, its shorter-than-standard length protects against piercing the bottom of the cork, which prevents cork fragments from marring the wine. A smart implement for frequent hosts and entertainers to keep on hand, the screw eliminates last-minute scrambles when preparing for large or small cocktail parties, holiday events, and other gatherings. Best of all, it provides up to 2,000 bottle openings before requiring replacement--which means a smoothly and efficiently functioning corkscrew from one occasion to the next. Crafted from high-quality materials, the replacement screw measures approximately 1 by 1 by 4-1/2 inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rkC1w9uSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B007FNM8OG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-628606","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007FNM8OG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007FNM8OG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":628607,"name":"Goldeny P013 Cool Snow Leopard Printed Bedding Sets Animal 3pcs with 1 Duvet Cover 2 Shams Gift for Boys Juniors Kids (Single 3pcs)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Gni2aeNxL._AC_.jpg","description":"3pcs bed cover set ( 1 duvet cover + 2 pillowcase)  Duvet Cover Set, Not Comforter Set, No Filling. Thanks  * Fabric: Microfiber  * Pattern: HD Digital Print (Do not fade color, do not bleed)  * Condition: Brand New  * Design:Colorful/Personalization  Please Kindly note: These are duvet cover set, not comforter, so no filling. A duvet cover is the protective cover that slips over the down comforter (or duvet), much like a pillow case on a pillow. Duvet covers are available in a wide variety of color and design choices. This opens up a whole world of possibility when the time comes to change the look of your bedroom, without having to purchase a new duvet. Most people find that they no longer need to use a top sheet when using a duvet cover, since the duvet cover doubles as a top sheet. This is nice because the duvet cover is not as prone to tangling, compared to a top-sheet. Plus, using a duvet cover with your duvet makes your bed much easier to make each morning, compared to using multiple blankets, a top sheet, a coverlet or bed spread, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Gni2aeNxL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Goldeny","source_asin":"B07CPJW8GQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-628607","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CPJW8GQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CPJW8GQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
