window.products.push({"id":628642,"name":"Zinus 14 Inch SmartBase Select with Mattress Stopper / Mattress Foundation / Platform Bed Frame / Box Spring Replacement, Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Dw1JuQHML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The SmartBase select mattress foundation by Zinus includes a mattress stopper to keep your mattress in place. The SmartBase eliminates the need for a box spring as your memory foam, spring or latex mattress should be placed directly on the SmartBase. Uniquely designed with a strong steel tube structure for optimum support and durability the mattress foundation has multiple points of Contact with the floor for stability and prevents mattress from sagging, increasing mattress life. The SmartBase select is 14 inches high with 13 inches of clearance under the frame for valuable under-bed storage space. With plastic caps to protect your floors and an innovative folding design to allow for easy storage, the SmartBase is well designed for ease of use. 5-Year limited warranty. Another comfort innovation from Zinus.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Dw1JuQHML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zinus","source_asin":"B071X7LRJZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-628642","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071X7LRJZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071X7LRJZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":628643,"name":"Lewistin Mouthwash Dispenser for Bathroom (12oz), Clear Glass Bottles Container with Stainless Steel Pour Spout w. 4 Reusable Glass Cups for Families,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61drip1IJ6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Thickened Glass]: This mouthwash dispenser set is made high-quality thickness glass, lead-free, BPA-free, ideal for long-term storage of mouthwash. 12oz mouthwash containers meet your daily needs, you can share this set with your family. 2 reusable 25ml (0.85oz) glass cups are designed for adults and the 15ml(0.5oz) cups are perfect for visitors. [Space Saving and More Hygienic]: 4 reusable glasses with cup holders, perfect for a family of 4. By hanging cups on a porcelain wall you can save space and keep your countertop clean and tidy. The cup holder plays the role of dustproof, fast drying and preventing the growth of bacteria. [Disposable Cups and Acrylic Cup Holder]: 21 Disposable Cups with Acrylic Cup Holders for your guests and family members. The cup holder is made of high quality acrylic, which is light and sturdy, features a front cutout and open top for easy cup access. Organize your cups to make your bathroom look neater and more elegant. [Heavy Metal Pour Spout]: Different from others this mouthwash dispenser set offers a well design stainless steel self-closing pour spouts. It will automatically close after each use, no dripping, stable structure, and can be used for a long time. This is a great decor for your bathroom or home. [Waterproof Labels & Stainless Funnels]: 1 Pre-written waterproof label and 1 blank DIY waterproof label, durable and waterproof can be a great decor for your bathroom. And the reusable stainless funnel is an easy way to smoothly pour mouthwash into the mouthwash container, without splashing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61drip1IJ6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lewistin","source_asin":"B0C397XYHK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-628643","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C397XYHK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C397XYHK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
