window.products.push({"id":628694,"name":"American Natural Stone Coasters- These Colors Don't Run Gift Box (Set Of 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712S20prFvL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"Our coaster sets feature public servants and military personnel who serve, 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, 365 days a year. Our American heroes face grueling mental and physical training regimens. Servicemen and women are our lifelines when in emergency situations, and they deserve recognition and appreciation. We show our pride for our country and for those who protect it by producing the highest quality merchandise to showcase their achievements and remind us of our blessed freedoms.  Each coaster set is made with chiseled, natural-stone, black slate. Slate is made from a mixture of clay minerals and tiny fragments of other minerals such as quartz and calcite. The composition of each piece is unique. After we separate the slate, we add a die cut municipal grade reflective vinyl, by hand, that features a patriotic design. Your furniture will be protected from dripping condensation, scratches and unsightly heat rings. They are the perfect size for all beverages, all day long, such as hot coffee in the morning, an afternoon soda, or a glass of wine with dinner. Our sets are great for parties too! If you invite friends over for dinner or drinks, you can set out a unique table attraction that will keep beer cool and your tables dry. Each coaster has a cork backing that is both functional, and stylish. It might look fantastic but the real reason we have chosen a light, airy cork base is to prevent any sliding when using our patriotic coasters. A spilled beverage can ruin your day and your carpet. Stay safe with these United States coasters.  We love our American hero coasters and our whole line of patriotic products. They make great gifts, especially for anyone who has ties to the USA as a serviceman, family or friend. It's stylish design and patriotic message appeals to many. Our coaster sets make an excellent housewarming gift or wedding present. They are fun in stocking stuffers or as birthday, anniversary, or \"just because\" gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712S20prFvL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Erazor Bits","source_asin":"B077FJ7DFT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-628694","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077FJ7DFT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077FJ7DFT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
