window.products.push({"id":628729,"name":"Ziplock Bag Storage Organizer for Kitchen Drawer, Acrylic Baggie Organizer Plastic Bag Dispenser Holder Compatible with Gallon, Quart, Sandwich, Snack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x51OcsJgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Keep Your Drawer Organized】- Make your drawer neat and organized with this acrylic ziplock bag organizer! The baggie organizer is designed specifically for your food storage bags organization. You will no more feel lamented that drawer in the kitchen that was always unorganized and had different size baggies and boxes strewn all over. It keeps everything organized! 【Sturdy & Durable Acrylic Material】- The sandwich bag storage organizer is made of durable and solid premium acrylic, waterproof and easy to clean, which not only can quickly get what you want but has a nice look! The transparent box lets you see at a glance how many bags are left, save more space and time. It's lightweight and flexible than the heave wood. 【Modern & Minimalistic Look】- A unique combination of clear and black, this plastic bag organizer will blend well with your existing furniture, looks very sleek and organized. Put it anywhere in your kitchen, and it won't look out of place! Every house should own these, it's also the perfect gift for your friends and family! 【Compatible With Most Brands】- The acrylic ziplock bag storage organizer has 4 compartments, can perfectly store various size of gallon bags, sandwich bags, quart bags, and snack bags (NOTE: Not compatible with quart size slider bag). There are 4 elegant labels on the box, making finding the right item quick and easy! 【Easy To Use】- Our storage bag organizer is fully assembled and designed fit for most drawers, 12''L X 12\"W X 3\"H, you can easily put it on the kitchen drawer, counter, cabinet. There are 4 mounting holes on the back, you can also hang it on the wall (Installation screws are provided in the package). You'll be so happy to get rid of all those different sized, flimsy storage bag boxes!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x51OcsJgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OugeWood","source_asin":"B0B2NQYFTZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-628729","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2NQYFTZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2NQYFTZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":628730,"name":"RENPHO Large Room Air Purifier 960 Ft², Air Quality Monitor, Smart Auto/Sleep Mode, True HEPA Filter, Home Air Purifier for Smokers Pet Hairs Pollen D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":124.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nij5OV-fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【5-STAGE FILTRATION & TRUE HEPA AIR PURIFIER】: RENPHO large room air purifier features a advanced 5-stage filtration system and 360-degree air outlet design. The Pre-Filter, Intercept Coating, True HEPA Filter, Activated Carbon Filter and Net Filter capture small airborne particles such as pet dander, pet hair, pollen, dust. Ideal for Pet Owners. 【UP TO 5 REFRESHES PER HOUR & HIGH PERFORMANCE】: RENPHO room air purifier refresh the air 5x per hour in rooms as large as 480 ft² / 44 m², cleans rooms up to 960 ft² in just 24 minutes. It's perfect for living rooms, kitchens, bedrooms, offices, restaurants, hotels, and more! 【SMART AUTO MODE WITH REAL-TIME AIR QUALITY MONITOR & 4 FAN SPEEDS】: In smart auto mode, the hepa air purifier large room will automatically adjust the fan speed based on real-time air quality. In addition, we have 4 adjustable fan speeds, you can choose the appropriate fan speed according to the air quality or personal needs. 【UNDISTURBED SLEEP MODE & 4 TIMER & LOCK SET】: The home air purifier purify the air with only 24 dB in sleep mode, suitable for a restful and soothing indoor environment, helping you sleep deeply. LED display will all be turned off so no harsh lights will bother you. The timer can be set to turn off the hepa air purifier after 2/4/6/8 hours, saving you even more energy and money. Child lock prevents error operations caused by pets or children and let them play freely. 【FILTER CHANGE INDICATOR】: The replacement indicator flashes in red to remind you to replace the air filter. We recommend replacing the filter every 6-8 months depending on the usage frequency and the air quality to ensure the best results. Search for RP-AP089-F1/ RP-AP089-F1-2/ RP-AP089-F2 (B08H7XR4KS / B08HWDPZZ6 / B08CB2FLTK) for GENUINE Replacement filter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nij5OV-fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RENPHO","source_asin":"B0C4D633JF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-628730","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4D633JF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4D633JF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
