window.products.push({"id":628752,"name":"Barware Gear Bottle Opener & Catcher Bundle: Wall Mounted Open Here Bottle Opener with Bottle Cap Catcher with FREE Stainless Steel Screws (Matted Nic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31X7rFheauL._AC_.jpg","description":"This bundle is made to make your life easier When it comes to opening those bottle requiring a bottle opener. But no worries, you can still use the wall mounted bottle opener if your bottles are twist off. The opener lets you open the bottle with one hand, and with the catcher right below (about 7 inches), the caps will fall right in without having to worry about clean up. The cap is wide enough for you to reach in and pull out the caps the next morning, or if clean up is due that night, just left the catcher up and out to go take the caps to the trash. The catcher should be able to hold one night's worth of bottle caps (estimated at 75 caps), unless you got a big party going on. Either way, clean up is fast and easy! The catcher is also nice for the people that like to keep the caps. This will save you the time and hassle of digging through the trash to get them. Size: Open Here Bottle Opener: 3.25\" tall x 2.75\" wide x 1.25\" deep  Brushed Stainless Steel Cap Catcher: 3.5\" tall x 5.5\" wide x 2.5\" deep What's Included One (1) Wall Mounted Opener  One (1) Wall Mounted Cap Catcher  Two (2) Sets of Stainless Steel Mounting Screws Why buy from Innovative Outdoor Network? We stand by our products  We truly appreciate every customer and want you to be completely 100% satisfied  We will answer any and all of our customer's questions within 24 hours  We offer a 100%, no questions asked, Money Back Guarantee. Click (ADD TO CART) Now and receive our premium bottle opener","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31X7rFheauL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Barware Gear","source_asin":"B06XWPQTDG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-628752","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XWPQTDG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XWPQTDG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
